s.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"提高你和其他友好生物对自己炸弹 %d%% 的元素伤害抗性，并增加 %d%% 对外界的元素伤害抗性。\n\t\t在等级 5 时它同时会保护你免疫你的炸弹所带来的特殊效果。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7a1cbb25f8ebf8dd9d60adfb30c5c6d0db110f9a3add827c5e70ac531a678358","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b4e6ce5ab6adb4f99d5d2b46b17b5b5b1661979d56cf2e0a7d9eaf0c7fde0d57","logical_entry_identity":"dd65833c2881954198e616699858d44c9f86734fe64365cfce615251b148ccf8","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Using a series of tricks and maneuvers, you switch places with your target.\n\t\tSwitching places will confuse your foes, granting you Evasion (50%%) for %d turns.\n\t\tWhile switching places, your weapon(s) will connect with the target; this will not do weapon damage, but on hit effects of the weapons can trigger.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"通过一系列的技巧和动作，你可以和你的目标交换位置。\n\t\t这个换位动作会迷惑你的敌人，让你获得持续 %d 回合的 50%% 概率躲闪效果。\n\t\t切换位置时，你的武器将会与目标连接；这不会造成武器伤害，但武器的命中效果会触发。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"42dd94764986c09fd9b0c5f5838658d4f7f3208e3b5ee8eb9236c871df01efd0","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b4e8d116ab15b10f0d2fa4378d8b762365c91978b2314a1461c8cbf4e94e5a4b","logical_entry_identity":"ab02af75cab22abd174e5de574316f550680acc8cb6ccba2897ba72beb4fe817","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#LIGHT_GREEN#* Yiilkgur has enough energy.#WHITE#","source_tag":"_t","target":"#LIGHT_GREEN#* 伊克格有足够的能量。#WHITE#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e37326ed4c6d5620154ff4d9bc067461fe5338e78d75031743d27e999c6628dc","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b4f18d237efed9a173fccdf76575658b1bc3c366f11e59f016c02314bbd35c33","logical_entry_identity":"d6495dc9684bf30f705371be769fbd6f47aaa696df899f5ac87177d0b431a641","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Thunderfall","source_tag":"entity name","target":"落雷"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"fd371e4ce3cb4450e632160968ed21b7867b6fe451308a42de9da5eebac34b66","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b4f72cb3fb0c3ee983d008f81ee10d0032d21f2cc4385